{
  "id": "EZK.29",
  "number": "29",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Esek. 29",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiserae ŋuna etoroniyaritere Ijipit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋitomon, elap ŋolo a ŋitomon, ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋiarei, abu Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lokoku a ituŋanan, kiŋoliya lowae ŋolo eyai Ijipit, ido todwar ŋakiro nu itoroniyarit Parao erwosit ŋolo a Ijipit ka ŋituŋa a Ijipit daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok iŋes atemar, alimu Ekapolon Akuj ŋakiro nu ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aŋun, alimu Ekapolon Akuj ŋakiro nu ebe, ‘Iyoŋ akwap a Ijipit ayauni ayoŋ neni kon ŋikaarak ŋulu etiŋito ŋileŋia, earete ikes ŋituŋa kon ka ŋityaŋ ŋulu eya tooma kon; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eruwor akwap a Ijipit ŋina asilon ka eruwor akoŋinait. Apaki nai ŋin eyenuniata Ŋijipitian atemar arae ayoŋ Ekapolon.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aŋuna abunio Parao tolimu ebe, ‘Erae aŋolol Nile ŋina kaŋ, ayoŋ etiyauni iŋes,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adau ayoŋ akiman Parao a ŋakiro a ŋun, adau ayoŋ akiman ŋakitelesyo a ŋakipi kon, eturuwori ayoŋ akwap a Ijipit akoŋinait ŋina ekyenare, ŋina asilon ameun alo Migidol tari Siyene tomyaa tari lokukor keŋ ka Esiopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam ituŋanan itori nakwap a Ijipit, mam etyaŋ itori nakwap a Ijipit, eruwor iŋes ŋina emam ibore eyakaun ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eturuwori ayoŋ akwap a Ijipit ŋina asilon, apei anakwapin a ŋuna asilok, esilunete ŋitaunio keŋ ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon, ikwaanikin ikes ka ŋitaunio ŋulu aruwor ŋireŋoroto. Eelari ayoŋ Ŋijipitian nakwapin ewuanak nakiboisyo ŋuna egelegelya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŋace ŋuna irworo Ekapolon Akuj ikes nu ebe, ‘Ani elunyarosi ŋikaru ŋul ŋatomoniomwon, acununi ayoŋ Ŋijipitian alotuŋa a ŋakwapin a ŋulu aponi kielakinae ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyakuni ayoŋ ikes aneni aponi torikoroe, enyaka nakwap kec Pasiros, nakwap atapapaa kec, ido eruwor ikes a nen apukan ŋina epalag. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruwor ikes apukan ŋina epalag akilo ŋunace mam nabo nyitopoloor iŋes bon anakwapin a ŋunace. Eturuwori ayoŋ ikes ŋulu epalag ŋulu nyepedorete nabo jik akipuka ŋakwapin ŋunace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyeruwor nabo jik Ŋijipitian ŋituŋa ŋulu epedorete Ŋisirael akikinyom, nai eruwor ibore ŋini itatamununui Ŋisirael asecit apaki ŋina elosyoto ikes akiŋarakino neni a Ŋijipitian. Apaki nai ŋin eyenuniata Ŋijipitian atemar arae ayoŋ Ekapolon.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eremi Babilonia Ijipit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikanikaarei, elap ŋolo ke epei, ŋirwa ke elap epei, abu Ekapolon kirwor neni kaŋ tema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lokoku a ituŋanan, abu erwosit Nebukadinesar ŋolo a Babilon ya ŋasigarya keŋ akirem Tiro aŋuna acamitor nooi akikamar; abu iŋes kisiwok ka kitoryoŋ ŋasigarya keŋ daadaŋ ŋiboro ŋulu apotyok, tolemar ŋitim anakyes kec ka tobuluciar ŋiseketa. Nai mam ibore apotu iŋes ka ŋasigarya keŋ toryamut anakimanit ka anacamit nooi akikamar Tiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, alimu Ekapolon Akuj ŋakiro nu ebe, ‘Alosi ayoŋ akipotokin Ijipit neni a Nebukadinesar a erwosit a Babilon, ikotere ya ebari a Ijipit, tolema ka toŋata ŋiboro a Ijipit toruwor eropit ŋolo a ŋasigarya keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adau ayoŋ ainakin Nebukadinesar akwap a Ijipit toruwor eropit ŋolo etiyaa iŋes, anerae abu iŋes ka ŋasigarya keŋ kitiyata aŋuna kaŋ.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akoloŋit ŋin, eturuwori ayoŋ Ŋisirael ŋulu egogoŋ, ido akacamakini iyoŋ Esekiel kirwor ŋakiro aneni epedoryata ŋituŋa daadaŋ akiirar iyoŋ, ikotere ikes eyenunete atemar arae ayoŋ Ekapolon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
